----------

  Unversioned v1, sent 2026-09-17/18, Message-ID stem
  20260918014017.2536753 (cover -1, patch 2/2 -3):
    https://lists.openwall.net/linux-kernel/2026/09/18/276
    https://lists.openwall.net/linux-kernel/2026/09/18/265

  Kameron Carr's vmbus_alloc_buffer(), the allocator this series builds
